uote":"三月，有司請立皇子為諸侯王。上曰：「趙幽王幽死，朕甚憐之，已立其長子遂為趙王。遂弟辟彊及齊悼惠王子朱虛侯章、東牟侯興居有功，可王。」乃立趙幽王少子辟彊為河閒王，以齊劇郡立朱虛侯為城陽王，立東牟侯為濟北王，皇子武為代王，子參為太原王，子揖為梁王。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"少子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"原文明示主張，不補未見姓名、闕代或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji050-013","subject_person_id":"cbr-p003178","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"cbr-p003161","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan","source_id":"s-shiji-050-chuyuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:p008","quote":"孝文帝即位二年，立遂弟辟彊，取趙之河閒郡為河閒王，（以）［是］為文王。立十三年卒，子哀王福立。一年卒，無子，絕後，國除，入于漢。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"遂弟辟彊","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示子、生與兄弟分型；劉交同母少弟保留限定，不由諸王繼位補未見血親，巨嫂不自動作信生母，德侯子不補父名或繼封。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji050-014","subject_person_id":"cbr-p003163","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p003178","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan","source_id":"s-shiji-050-chuyuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:p008","quote":"孝文帝即位二年，立遂弟辟彊，取趙之河閒郡為河閒王，（以）［是］為文王。立十三年卒，子哀王福立。一年卒，無子，絕後，國除，入于漢。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子哀王福立","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示子、生與兄弟分型；劉交同母少弟保留限定，不由諸王繼位補未見血親，巨嫂不自動作信生母，德侯子不補父名或繼封。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji050-024","person_id":"cbr-p003178","title":"河閒王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan","source_id":"s-shiji-050-chuyuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:p008","quote":"孝文帝即位二年，立遂弟辟彊，取趙之河閒郡為河閒王，（以）［是］為文王。立十三年卒，子哀王福立。一年卒，無子，絕後，國除，入于漢。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji050-024:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:p008","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"河閒王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-050-chuyuan:m008-0011","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":"孝文帝即位二年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-05